A web aquarium management application that assists fishkeepers to organize and maintain their aquariums. 

--------------------

TankTrack is a project that is focused on helping aquarium hobbyists manage their tanks, recurring care routines and equipment in one site.
Having an aquarium means you have the responsibility of feeding fishes, fertilizing, upkeeping equipment maintenance, and other routine tasks. TankTrack aims to make these responsibilities easier to look after, through a centralized location to manage your aquarium information.


